@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = replace-with-a-valid-access-token

### Chat completion (requires authenticated user and Chat:Endpoint/Chat:Model configuration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What can you help me with?",
  "history": []
}

### Validation error: blank message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": " ",
  "history": []
}

### Confirm a pending action returned by POST /api/chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/actions/{{actionId}}/confirm
Authorization: ******

### Discard a pending action
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/actions/{{actionId}}
Authorization: ******
